(only if it isn't already)" style="sketch=1;fontFamily=Comic Sans MS;strokeColor=#000000;fontColor=#000000;rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="510" y="110" width="210" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="d3" value="3. Pick out the key facts —
place, what happened,
how many people, when,
how bad the damage is" style="sketch=1;fontFamily=Comic Sans MS;strokeColor=#000000;fontColor=#000000;rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="770" y="110" width="220" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="d4" value="4. Turn those facts into
