(only if there is one)" style="sketch=1;fontFamily=Comic Sans MS;strokeColor=#000000;fontColor=#000000;rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1050" y="205" width="240" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="d7" value="7. Combine the text and
